        <mxCell id="flows-pay_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Access is granted only by the server.&lt;/b&gt; resolve_deposit runs after the API's own status check (amount and currency included); the browser redirect and webhook bodies are never trusted. reconcile_payments (every 10 min) catches missed callbacks. PawaPay prompts the payer's phone, not the browser. With ENFORCE_SINGLE_DEVICE_VIEW on, a view is bound to one device and consumed at ≥ 90 % progress. Demo mode settles payments without calling a provider." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#C9A227;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="flows-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1145" width="1040" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
