        <mxCell id="flows-up_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Uploads require a ready producer&lt;/b&gt; (profile completed + signed distribution agreement). The browser sends file bytes straight to R2; the API only signs parts and checks that the key belongs to the caller. An approved film is listed; it is buyable and playable once release_at passes (checked on every request). publish_releases only announces releases. reset_stale_transcodes re-queues stuck jobs. Talent videos use the same multipart flow, then an ffprobe check and admin moderation." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#C9A227;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="flows-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="1145" width="1170" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
